00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:18.000
But we have a tendency to make things difficult for ourselves. The Quran says that. The Quran says,

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:23.000
If you, if we, if we listen to you, you'll make things more miserable and difficult for yourselves.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:32.000
So, God said, the rich compensates according to his wealth and the poor compensates according to his abilities.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:38.000
Dr. Khalifa: And this is, it's Merciful that He didn't say you have to give this much or this proportion.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:41.000
