Now, because you're doing God's commandment, God controls your heart and their hearts, and everything will go just wonderful.

00:33:05.000 --> 00:33:08.000
But you just have to exhort them. You have to keep telling them.

00:33:10.000 --> 00:33:14.000
My children are grown up now, but when they were young, I will ask them.

00:33:14.000 --> 00:33:19.000
They're willing, willing doing the Prayers, but I had to remind them every day. If I, if I

00:33:19.000 --> 00:33:25.000
If I don't carry out God's commandment, and I wait until two in the afternoon and ask them "did you Pray the Noon?"

00:33:25.000 --> 00:33:27.000
"No, we'll go pray."

